This project's crowd-navigation policy code (crowd_nav_policy_adapters) is
derived in part from vita-epfl/CrowdNav (MIT License) and a fork providing a
pretrained SARL checkpoint (see docs/phase0-findings.md for the exact lineage
and license inheritance). Nav2, ROS 2, and Gazebo are used as unmodified
upstream dependencies under their own respective licenses (Apache 2.0 /
Apache 2.0 / Apache 2.0), not redistributed as part of this repository.
